  "notes": [
    "Live REA stdio MCP over the main+DllBattle carrier (analyses from the battle sessions, byte reads in session outputs/rea-battle-6, the same carrier); every instruction and literal word equals the original DllBattle.cro bytes, except literal 108ba334 (Brick Break's hook 108baba4), an ABS32 relocation whose original word and S+A value are checked.",
